END-DEFINE
*
SET KEY PF3
*
INPUT USING MAP 'HMBURP&'
IF *PF-KEY = 'PF3' ESCAPE ROUTINE
END-IF
*
* xsethz  2000-08-07 (CE7461) FOLLOWING LINE COMMENTED OUT
